{"repositoryId":1096537758,"availability":"available","full":"dhruvht612/My_Portfolio","name":"My_Portfolio","description":"Explore this public GitHub project.","category":"Design","language":"JavaScript","stars":0,"forks":0,"created":"2025-11-14T15:15:00Z","updated":"2026-10-19T03:41:41Z","license":"MIT","branch":"main","homepage":"https://my-portfolio-chi-one-46.vercel.app","topics":[],"demo":"https://www.thakardhruv.me/","color":"#25392f","ink":"#d1e5c5","lastCheckedAt":"2026-10-19T06:19:53.713Z","lastAttemptAt":"2026-10-19T06:19:53.713Z","lastAvailableAt":"2026-10-19T06:19:53.713Z","metrics":[{"at":"2026-10-19T06:19:53.713Z","stars":0,"forks":0}],"technologies":[],"overview":{"kind":"readme","version":1,"paragraphs":["A personal portfolio that runs as one live WebGL city, with a Supabase-backed admin CMS behind it.","Most portfolio templates felt static and difficult to maintain at scale. I wanted a system where portfolio content could be managed like a lightweight CMS while still feeling modern, animated, and developer-focused.","This project became both my portfolio and an experiment in reusable frontend/admin architecture using React, Supabase, and modular UI systems."],"features":["Work highlighted on the portfolio (also manageable from Admin → Projects).","Accessibility-first indoor routing: physical barriers, sensory-heavy zones, calm warnings, and alternate paths. Unified accessibility graph with crowdsourced data and AI-assisted labels.","Goal CRUD, Plaid (sandbox) bank sync, real-time progress from categorized transactions, and a local Ollama assistant for spending insights.","The site you are reading about: a WebGL city as the public site, a Supabase contact inbox, analytics dashboard, system health probes, and workspace-style admin modules (profile, projects, skills, education,…","Internix — AI internship copilot"],"sourceUrl":"https://github.com/dhruvht612/My_Portfolio/blob/main/README.md","fingerprint":"d3e150d8ba5e5e43682e1a9e1b883605e967a17f100b3a